# Floor in the terminal: the same five sections, plain text, over the same live.json. Owner request 2026-09-13. 2026-09-13
#
# DISPATCH: ./scripts/dispatch.sh git@github.com:Arlencho/dev-agents.git wave-plans/dev-agents/2026-09-13-floor-terminal-view.plan --detach --retries 1
# Why: the owner works in the terminal; a tab switch is a gap. Same data, second renderer, never a second source of truth.
